<hgroup><h1>Efficacy and Safety of Tapinarof for Atopic Dermatitis: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis of Randomized Controlled Trials</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Saifi%20BA"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Baraa A Saifi</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">Baraa A Saifi</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>
Department of Medicine, Lebanese American University (LAU) Gilbert and Rose-Marie Chagoury School of Medicine, Byblos, LBN </div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Saifi%20BA"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Baraa A Saifi</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Saifi%20ZA"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id2"><span class="name western">Zyad A Saifi</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id2">
<h3><span class="name western">Zyad A Saifi</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>2</sup>
Faculty of Medicine, American University of Beirut Medical Center, Beirut, LBN </div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Saifi%20ZA"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Zyad A Saifi</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>2</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Emmanuel%20N"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id3"><span class="name western">Nancy Emmanuel</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id3">
<h3><span class="name western">Nancy Emmanuel</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>3</sup>
Department of Dermatology, Faculty of Medicine, University of São Paulo, São Paulo, BRA </div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Emmanuel%20N"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Nancy Emmanuel</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>3,</sup><sup>✉</sup>
</div>
<div class="cg p">Editors: <span class="name western">Alexander Muacevic</span>, <span class="name western">John R Adler</span>
</div>
<ul class="d-buttons inline-list">
<li><button class="d-button" aria-controls="aip_a" aria-expanded="false">Author information</button></li>
